      "scope": "SAMHITA ONLY, Sakala recension. This work_id addresses the 10,552 mantras of the Rigveda Samhita in the Sakala recension and nothing else. It does not address a second Rigvedic recension, nor any post-samhita layer: no Brahmana, no Aranyaka and no Upanisad are held. Padapatha and the accented samhitapatha are carried as text versions of these same mantras, not as separate works.",
      "completeness": "10,552 of 10,552 attested mantras carry a canonical key and a canonical citation (100.0%). 10,502 of 10,552 carry a translation (99.5%). No shortfall in addressing.",
      "excluded_corpora": [
